WEBVTT

00:00:00.565 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.161 --> 00:00:04.190
What's the most effective advertising that costs almost nothing?

00:00:04.451 --> 00:00:06.670
Your regulars recommending you to their friends.

00:00:06.811 --> 00:00:11.150
With VaraaAi loyalty cards, every customer has their own invite link.

00:00:11.331 --> 00:00:15.150
When a friend comes to your salon, the customer gets two bonus tickets.

00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:17.321
There's nothing extra to set up.

00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:20.203
You just need your loyalty card programme switched on,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.121
and a card activated for the customer.

00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:25.401
The invite link is already built into each customer's card.

00:00:25.995 --> 00:00:29.989
The customer opens their card, scrolls down to Invite a friend,

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:31.805
and taps Copy my invite link,

00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:35.485
or the share button, to send it by message or on social media.

00:00:36.084 --> 00:00:40.099
The friend opens the link, and sees an invitation with the customer's name,

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:42.214
along with the salon's popular services.

00:00:42.564 --> 00:00:45.574
They tap Book now, and choose a service and a time.

00:00:45.941 --> 00:00:47.843
The link is remembered for sixty days,

00:00:47.793 --> 00:00:50.134
so it still counts if they book a little later.

00:00:50.641 --> 00:00:53.443
When the friend visits your salon for the first time,

00:00:53.393 --> 00:00:56.610
the customer who invited them automatically gets two tickets,

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.370
and an email with the good news.

00:00:58.674 --> 00:01:02.930
Only new customers on their first visit count, and nobody can invite themselves.

00:01:03.225 --> 00:01:06.292
Remember to mention it at the counter, right after the treatment,

00:01:06.242 --> 00:01:07.730
when your customer is happiest.

00:01:07.919 --> 00:01:09.170
Now take the quiz below.
